{
  "title": "The Five-Minute Fix",
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "showcase-en",
      "title": "Alex: One click, nine jobs",
      "language": "en",
      "url": "/samples/conversations/01-english/original.wav",
      "duration": 35.030208,
      "captions": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "audioLanguage": "en",
          "cues": [
            {
              "start": 0.176,
              "end": 2.376,
              "text": "Hey, can someone take a look at\nthe export queue?"
            },
            { "start": 2.938, "end": 3.773, "text": "I added retries." },
            {
              "start": 4.287,
              "end": 6.872,
              "text": "Six lines, thought I'd be out of\nhere in five minutes."
            },
            {
              "start": 7.241,
              "end": 8.975,
              "text": "Now I've got nine jobs from one click."
            },
            { "start": 9.489, "end": 10.244, "text": "There are 12 now." },
            { "start": 10.629, "end": 11.303, "text": "It's still going up!" },
            {
              "start": 11.994,
              "end": 15.382,
              "text": "And before you ask, no, I didn't sit\nthere clicking the button."
            },
            {
              "start": 16.008,
              "end": 17.678,
              "text": "I clicked once and went to get water."
            },
            {
              "start": 18.015,
              "end": 22.35,
              "text": "The page says it failed, but something's\ndefinitely running because the servers are"
            },
            { "start": 22.35, "end": 22.993, "text": "getting hammered." },
            {
              "start": 23.571,
              "end": 25.144,
              "text": "I'll put the job numbers in the chat."
            },
            {
              "start": 25.53,
              "end": 27.542,
              "text": "Can you check what's still running\nafter the timeout?"
            },
            {
              "start": 27.816,
              "end": 30.908,
              "text": "I think I've made the same problem\nhappen faster, so that's nice."
            },
            {
              "start": 31.6,
              "end": 32.985,
              "text": "I was about to close my laptop too."
            },
            {
              "start": 33.709,
              "end": 34.772,
              "text": "Apparently we're doing this now."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "language": "pt",
          "audioLanguage": "en",
          "cues": [
            {
              "start": 0.176,
              "end": 2.376,
              "text": "Ei, alguém pode dar uma olhada na\nfila de exportação?"
            },
            { "start": 2.938, "end": 3.773, "text": "Adicionei retentativas." },
            {
              "start": 4.287,
              "end": 6.872,
              "text": "Seis linhas, achei que sairia\ndaqui em cinco minutos."
            },
            {
              "start": 7.241,
              "end": 8.975,
              "text": "Agora tenho nove tarefas com\num único clique."
            },
            { "start": 9.489, "end": 10.244, "text": "Agora são 12." },
            { "start": 10.629, "end": 11.303, "text": "Ainda está subindo!" },
            {
              "start": 11.994,
              "end": 15.382,
              "text": "E antes que você pergunte, não, não\nfiquei lá clicando no botão."
            },
            {
              "start": 16.008,
              "end": 17.678,
              "text": "Cliquei uma vez e fui pegar água."
            },
            {
              "start": 18.015,
              "end": 20.285,
              "text": "A página diz que falhou, mas\ncom certeza tem"
            },
            {
              "start": 20.286,
              "end": 22.35,
              "text": "algo rodando, porque os servidores estão"
            },
            { "start": 22.35, "end": 22.993, "text": "sobrecarregados." },
            {
              "start": 23.571,
              "end": 25.144,
              "text": "Vou colocar os números das\ntarefas no chat."
            },
            {
              "start": 25.53,
              "end": 27.542,
              "text": "Você pode conferir o que ainda está\nrodando após o tempo limite?"
            },
            {
              "start": 27.816,
              "end": 30.908,
              "text": "Acho que fiz o mesmo problema ocorrer\nmais rápido, então que ótimo."
            },
            {
              "start": 31.6,
              "end": 32.985,
              "text": "Eu já estava quase fechando o\nnotebook também."
            },
            {
              "start": 33.709,
              "end": 34.772,
              "text": "Pelo visto, vamos ter que\nresolver isso agora."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "language": "zh",
          "audioLanguage": "en",
          "cues": [
            {
              "start": 0.176,
              "end": 2.376,
              "text": "嘿，有人能看一下导出队列吗？"
            },
            { "start": 2.938, "end": 3.773, "text": "我加了重试机制。" },
            {
              "start": 4.287,
              "end": 6.872,
              "text": "就六行代码，我还以为五分钟就能搞定走人。"
            },
            {
              "start": 7.241,
              "end": 8.975,
              "text": "结果点了一下就冒出九个任务。"
            },
            { "start": 9.489, "end": 10.244, "text": "现在变成12个了。" },
            { "start": 10.629, "end": 11.303, "text": "还在往上涨！" },
            {
              "start": 11.994,
              "end": 15.382,
              "text": "先别问，我可没坐在那儿一直狂点按钮。"
            },
            {
              "start": 16.008,
              "end": 17.678,
              "text": "我就点了一次，然后去接了杯水。"
            },
            {
              "start": 18.015,
              "end": 22.35,
              "text": "页面显示失败了，但肯定有东西在运行，因为服务器"
            },
            { "start": 22.35, "end": 22.993, "text": "快被打爆了。" },
            {
              "start": 23.571,
              "end": 25.144,
              "text": "我把任务编号发在聊天里。"
            },
            {
              "start": 25.53,
              "end": 27.542,
              "text": "能帮忙看看超时之后还有什么在运行吗？"
            },
            {
              "start": 27.816,
              "end": 30.908,
              "text": "我好像只是让同一个问题发生得更快了，真不错。"
            },
            {
              "start": 31.6,
              "end": 32.985,
              "text": "我刚才都准备合上电脑了。"
            },
            {
              "start": 33.709,
              "end": 34.772,
              "text": "看来我们现在得处理这个了。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "renditions": [
        {
          "language": "pt",
          "url": "/samples/conversations/01-english/dub-portuguese.wav",
          "duration": 35.587667
