    {
      "id": "showcase-pt",
      "title": "Marina: The work never stopped",
      "language": "pt",
      "url": "/samples/conversations/02-portuguese/original.wav",
      "duration": 42.031021,
      "captions": [
        {
          "language": "pt",
          "audioLanguage": "pt",
          "cues": [
            {
              "start": 0.256,
              "end": 2.152,
              "text": "Tá, achei as tarefas na fila."
            },
            {
              "start": 3.003,
              "end": 5.686,
              "text": "É, a primeira tentativa não parou."
            },
            {
              "start": 6.44,
              "end": 8.095,
              "text": "Quem desistiu foi a página."
            },
            {
              "start": 8.786,
              "end": 11.789,
              "text": "O servidor continuou fazendo o\nrelatório normalmente."
            },
            {
              "start": 12.4,
              "end": 14.825,
              "text": "Aí chegou outra tentativa e\ncomeçou tudo de novo."
            },
            {
              "start": 15.194,
              "end": 18.696,
              "text": "Não é uma fila de coisas diferentes, é a\nmesma coisa várias vezes."
            },
            {
              "start": 19.065,
              "end": 22.149,
              "text": "Inclusive o mesmo gráfico, que\ncontinua sem explicar nada."
            },
            { "start": 22.68, "end": 23.354, "text": "E tem mais." },
            {
              "start": 23.804,
              "end": 28.173,
              "text": "O serviço que recebe as chamadas já\ntenta três vezes antes de devolver um erro."
            },
            {
              "start": 28.623,
              "end": 32.035,
              "text": "Então, a mudança nova está repetindo uma\noperação que já se repete."
            },
            {
              "start": 32.55,
              "end": 35.641,
              "text": "Peraí, o processo em segundo\nplano também faz isso?"
            },
            {
              "start": 36.333,
              "end": 37.588,
              "text": "Vou mandar os registros."
            },
            {
              "start": 38.184,
              "end": 41.773,
              "text": "Por enquanto, ninguém aperta o botão,\nnem para ver se melhorou."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "language": "en",
          "audioLanguage": "pt",
          "cues": [
            {
              "start": 0.256,
              "end": 2.152,
              "text": "Okay, I found the tasks in the queue."
            },
            {
              "start": 3.003,
              "end": 5.686,
              "text": "Yeah, the first attempt didn't finish."
            },
            {
              "start": 6.44,
              "end": 8.095,
              "text": "The page was the one that\nstopped responding."
            },
            {
              "start": 8.786,
              "end": 11.789,
              "text": "The server kept generating the\nreport normally."
            },
            {
              "start": 12.4,
              "end": 14.825,
              "text": "Then another attempt came in and started\neverything all over again."
            },
            {
              "start": 15.194,
              "end": 18.696,
              "text": "It's not a queue of different things,\nit's the same thing multiple times."
            },
            {
              "start": 19.065,
              "end": 22.149,
              "text": "Including the same chart, which still\ndoesn't explain anything."
            },
            { "start": 22.68, "end": 23.354, "text": "And there's more." },
            {
              "start": 23.804,
              "end": 26.09,
              "text": "The service receiving the\ncalls already makes"
            },
            {
              "start": 26.091,
              "end": 28.173,
              "text": "three attempts before returning an error."
            },
            {
              "start": 28.623,
              "end": 32.035,
              "text": "So, the new change is repeating an\noperation that already repeats itself."
            },
            {
              "start": 32.55,
              "end": 35.641,
              "text": "Wait, does the background\nprocess do that too?"
            },
            { "start": 36.333, "end": 37.588, "text": "I'll send the logs." },
            {
              "start": 38.184,
              "end": 41.773,
              "text": "For now, nobody should press the\nbutton—not even to check whether it improved."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "language": "zh",
          "audioLanguage": "pt",
          "cues": [
            {
              "start": 0.256,
              "end": 2.152,
              "text": "好，我找到队列里的任务了。"
            },
            {
              "start": 3.003,
              "end": 5.686,
              "text": "是的，第一次尝试并没有停下。"
            },
            { "start": 6.44, "end": 8.095, "text": "是页面先放弃了。" },
            {
              "start": 8.786,
              "end": 11.789,
              "text": "服务器一直在正常生成报告。"
            },
            {
              "start": 12.4,
              "end": 14.825,
              "text": "然后又来了一次尝试，一切又重新开始了。"
            },
            {
              "start": 15.194,
              "end": 18.696,
              "text": "这不是一堆不同的任务排成队，而是同一件事重复了好几次。"
            },
            {
              "start": 19.065,
              "end": 22.149,
              "text": "包括那个依然什么都没说明白的相同图表。"
            },
            { "start": 22.68, "end": 23.354, "text": "而且还不止这些。" },
            {
              "start": 23.804,
              "end": 28.173,
              "text": "接收调用的服务在返回错误之前本身就会重试三次。"
            },
            {
              "start": 28.623,
              "end": 32.035,
              "text": "所以，这次的新改动是在重复一个本就会重复的操作。"
            },
            {
              "start": 32.55,
              "end": 35.641,
              "text": "等等，后台进程也是这样吗？"
            },
            { "start": 36.333, "end": 37.588, "text": "我去把日志发过去。" },
            {
              "start": 38.184,
              "end": 41.773,
              "text": "目前先别有人按那个按钮，也别为了看看有没有好转而去按它。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "renditions": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "url": "/samples/conversations/02-portuguese/dub-english.wav",
          "duration": 42.031062
        },
        {
          "language": "zh",
          "url": "/samples/conversations/02-portuguese/dub-chinese.wav",
          "duration": 42.031062
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "showcase-zh",
      "title": "Chen: Why the jobs multiply",
      "language": "zh",
      "url": "/samples/conversations/03-chinese/original.wav",
      "duration": 57.521646,
      "captions": [
        {
          "language": "zh",
          "audioLanguage": "zh",
          "cues": [
            {
              "start": 0.66,
              "end": 3.6,
              "text": "嗯， 后台 这边 也 会 重试 三次。"
            },
            {
              "start": 4.61,
              "end": 11.39,
              "text": "等一下， 不是 三次 重试， 是 最 多 执行 三次， 第一次 也 算。"
            },
            {
              "start": 11.64,
              "end": 18.54,
              "text": "调用 方 三次， 网关 三次， 后台 再 来 三次， 一个 按钮 最"
            },
            {
              "start": 18.54,
              "end": 24.88,
              "text": "多 二十七 次。 每 一层 都 觉得 自己 挺 负责 的， 问题 是"
            },
            {
              "start": 24.88,
              "end": 31.39,
              "text": "请求 超时 了。 生成 报告 的 任务 没停，新 的 请求 又 没有 带上"
            },
            {
              "start": 31.39,
              "end": 37.63,
              "text": "同一个 请求 编号， 所以 系统 觉得 哦， 又 来 一份， 这 不是"
            },
            {
              "start": 37.63,
              "end": 44.35,
              "text": "恢复能力， 这是 重复劳动。 先 关掉 刚加 的 自动 重试， 别 再 提交"
            },
            {
              "start": 44.35,
              "end": 51.23,
              "text": "了， 让 队列 慢慢 清完。 去 重 的 事 得 单独 补。\n我查 一下 这段 老代码 是"
            },
            {
              "start": 51.23,
              "end": 56.53,
              "text": "谁 写 的？ 嗯， 这个 人 好像 就 在 群里。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "language": "en",
          "audioLanguage": "zh",
          "cues": [
            {
              "start": 0.66,
              "end": 3.6,
              "text": "Yeah, the backend will also\nretry three times."
            },
            {
              "start": 4.61,
              "end": 8.036,
              "text": "Wait a minute, not three\nretries—it executes at"
            },
            {
              "start": 8.037,
              "end": 11.39,
              "text": "most three times, including the\nfirst attempt."
            },
            {
              "start": 11.64,
              "end": 15.029,
              "text": "Three times for the caller, three\ntimes for the gateway,"
            },
            {
              "start": 15.03,
              "end": 18.54,
              "text": "and another three times on the\nbackend—one button click at"
            },
            {
              "start": 18.54,
              "end": 21.884,
              "text": "most twenty-seven times. Every\nlayer thinks it's"
            },
            {
              "start": 21.885,
              "end": 24.88,
              "text": "being quite responsible, but\nthe problem is"
            },
            {
              "start": 24.88,
              "end": 28.273,
              "text": "the request timed out. The\nreport generation task"
            },
            {
              "start": 28.274,
              "end": 31.39,
              "text": "didn't stop, and the new\nrequest didn't carry"
            },
            {
              "start": 31.39,
              "end": 37.63,
              "text": "the same request ID, so the system\nthinks, 'Oh, here's another one.' This isn't"
            },
            {
              "start": 37.63,
              "end": 41.116,
              "text": "resilience, this is redundant work.\nFirst, turn off the"
            },
            {
              "start": 41.117,
              "end": 44.35,
              "text": "auto-retry that was just added,\nand stop submitting"
            },
            {
              "start": 44.35,
              "end": 47.79,
              "text": "more; let the queue slowly clear out.\nDeduplication needs to"
            },
            {
              "start": 47.791,
              "end": 51.23,
              "text": "be patched separately. Let me check\nwho this legacy code was"
            },
            {
              "start": 51.23,
              "end": 56.53,
              "text": "written by? Hmm, looks like this person\nis right here in the group chat."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "language": "pt",
          "audioLanguage": "zh",
          "cues": [
            {
              "start": 0.66,
              "end": 3.6,
              "text": "É, aqui no back-end também vai\ntentar três vezes."
            },
            {
              "start": 4.61,
              "end": 7.962,
              "text": "Espera aí, não são três novas\ntentativas; são"
            },
            {
              "start": 7.963,
              "end": 11.39,
              "text": "no máximo três execuções,\ncontando a primeira."
            },
            {
              "start": 11.64,
              "end": 18.54,
              "text": "Três no cliente, três no gateway e mais\ntrês no back-end: um único clique pode"
            },
            {
              "start": 18.54,
              "end": 21.839,
              "text": "resultar em até vinte e sete\nexecuções. Cada camada"
            },
            {
              "start": 21.84,
              "end": 24.88,
              "text": "acha que está fazendo a sua\nparte, o problema é"
            },
            {
              "start": 24.88,
              "end": 27.985,
              "text": "que a requisição expirou o tempo\nlimite. A tarefa de"
            },
            {
              "start": 27.986,
              "end": 31.39,
              "text": "gerar o relatório não parou, e a\nnova requisição veio sem"
            },
            {
              "start": 31.39,
              "end": 37.63,
              "text": "o mesmo ID de requisição, então o\nsistema acha: \"Opa, veio outra\". Isso não é"
            },
            {
              "start": 37.63,
              "end": 40.895,
              "text": "resiliência, é retrabalho.\nPrimeiro desativem a nova"
            },
            {
              "start": 40.896,
              "end": 44.35,
              "text": "tentativa automática\nrecém-adicionada e parem de enviar"
            },
            {
              "start": 44.35,
              "end": 47.935,
              "text": "novas requisições; deixem a fila\nesvaziar aos poucos. A desduplicação terá"
            },
            {
              "start": 47.936,
              "end": 51.23,
              "text": "que ser feita à parte. Deixa eu checar\nesse código antigo para saber"
            },
            {
              "start": 51.23,
              "end": 56.53,
              "text": "quem o escreveu... É, parece que essa\npessoa está aqui no grupo."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "renditions": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "url": "/samples/conversations/03-chinese/dub-english.wav",
